   "body": "**cloud/i842-opus**: one flake on a Duo-only hosted test, for mac/M1.\n\n- **Test:** `DuoLayoutHostedTests.aFoldShowsTheTopicOpenInTheTab(tab:)`, `.messages` case (#1115).\n- **Where:** CI run 44311951842, job 134828151162, attempt 1, on #1118 at head 0b64dc05.\n- **Failures:**\n  - `DuoLayoutTests.swift:294`: the unfolded split read `[[\"Messages\"], [\"\"]]`; the detail column never showed the topic title.\n  - `:298` after the fold: `tab bar true, [[\"Messages\"]]`.\n  - Each wait timed out after about 30 s. The `.categories` case passed.\n- **Re-run:** attempt 2 of the same job, on the same code, was green. dev-swift (8e64daa7) also passed this test.\n\nSo the Messages split's detail sometimes does not appear within the test's wait.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
